# Allow-list: only what the Dockerfile COPYs reaches the Docker daemon
# (keeps venvs, AirSim binaries, logs and ros2_ws out of the build context).
*
!requirements.txt
!setup/install_requirements.sh
!config.py
!utils_*.py
!node_*.py
!test_*.py
!publish_cameras.py
!write_calibration_yaml.py
!patch/
!litemono/
**/__pycache__
